  "description": "3 setups on my watchlist this week, with the exact prices I’m waiting for.",
  "body_html": "<p>Everyone is panicking about last Friday’s <strong>“Strong Jobs Report”</strong>, which revived speculation that the Federal Reserve could raise interest rates again. That puts even more attention on <strong>CPI and PPI this week</strong>. If inflation comes in hotter than expected, it would strengthen the case for another rate hike and likely add more pressure to an already nervous market.</p><p>That leads directly into another growing concern: <strong>Treasury yields</strong>. Yields have been climbing as investors adjust to the possibility of higher rates, making bonds more attractive relative to stocks and putting additional pressure on stock valuations.</p><p>And then there’s the question hanging over this entire market: <strong>How long can AI and tech keep carrying it?</strong> Despite all of these concerns, strength in technology has helped keep the broader market near its highs. If yields remain elevated and rate expectations turn even more hawkish, we may find out just how much heavy lifting AI and tech can continue to do.</p><p>Panic. Panic. Panic. ALL YEAR LONG. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4><strong>Odds are really good that rates will go up, several times, in the next year. Get over it. </strong></h4><p>I have never seen CME Forecasts miss on their Target Rate Probabilities, but odds are leaning 60% that we will have a our first rate hike this month. Look out the next year, to September 2027, and odds lean heavily towards having 2 to 3 rate hikes! </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"801\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/af7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:801,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:235842,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/214576874?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zyGn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faf7d6129-237d-4af6-a867-ae0fbbaccbc3_2598x1430.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>So where do I stand? <strong>Still your resident permabull. </strong>Don’t get me wrong, I do think a large scale correction is brewing in the future, but right now, I expect this market bubble to continue getting bigger. Most of these “fears” have been priced in, months ago. We are seeing individual names break down, finally. Which has shifted me to focusing on index funds, silver, silver miners, energy and essentially any “recession resistant” stocks, as they run longer. Also, Financial Stocks, that we have been involved with since February, are showing more bullish continuations.</p><p>We have been dealing with this market panic all year long, and what happened: </p><h4>The S&amp;P 500 has hit 27 all time highs this year.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></h4><p>Going into this week, I have several stocks and assets on my watchlist with specific price ranges where I would consider entering.</p><p><strong>You do NOT need to copy my entries exactly, or rush to read these posts the second they come out.</strong> These are longer-term trades, so I’m looking for good entries, not perfect ones. There is plenty of time to evaluate the setup and make your own decision. You can also swing by the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d18286d6-5152-4f20-85c8-cedb68ee0e71\">Main Chat</a> if you have questions and want to verify if I think the ticker is still valid. </p><h4><strong>Here’s 3 stocks I’m watching this week and the price ranges I’m waiting for:</strong></h4>",
